Projection function:
```python
def operative(v):
    s = str(v)
    s = s.split(";")[0]           # drop trailing clauses after ';'
    s = re.sub(r"\([^()]*\)", "", s)  # drop parenthetical glosses
    s = re.sub(r"\s+", " ", s).strip().lower()
    return s
```
